<title>JAPAN: Showa Shell 1997 turnaround schedule.</title>
<headline>Showa Shell 1997 turnaround schedule.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Showa Shell Sekiyu KK said on Friday that its schedule for maintenance closures of its crude distillation units (CDUs) in 1997 is as follows (capacity in barrels per day):</p>
<p>	CDU		     CAPACITY	 CLOSURE SCHEDULE</p>
<p>    Kawasaki		  120,000	one month from mid-Aug</p>
<p>    Niigata		    40,000	two weeks in June</p>
<p>Showa Shell Sekiyu KK 50 percent owned by the Royal Dutch/Shell Group.</p>
</text>
